        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "3b9835c8e93e7534a9537f7386433683cc965d8d5a3496d7eba284da847ba623"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-805d144f549c45af",
        "text": "```bash\nsudo python3 /var/lib/vastai_kaalia/enable_vms.py off\n```",
        "headings": [
