        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "dca33fac3c96a0a383a60a1b7566ee1b93050553b0080134fbbbff77c3efc4d5"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-1bbbc88edc5f88d7",
        "text": "```bash\nsudo python3 /var/lib/vastai_kaalia/enable_vms.py on -f\n```",
        "headings": [
          "Retry Enablement"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 108,
            "end": 110,
            "text_sha256": "f1eb2b3b6c47626bd9a13b771133fd77429c8c1b634925a87cb4db0f0bc9c7ea"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "43980bae78d4dbf56c00fe06f5ec909a7ba9145c5653b0e4acb8416e596de0d1"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-0695e1ca56eca6d4",
        "text": "Do not use process exit status alone as evidence of success. The helper can print an error such as `IOMMU groups not set up for VMs, aborting.` while exiting with status `0`.",
        "headings": [
          "Retry Enablement"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 112,
            "end": 112,
            "text_sha256": "b1ab6cda91e2f5a1460b0a5f48a497b1b89f80455bec768aa7cb10f5378a8b35"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "aed66c3678c6e0ea476980812be4a9e221333419bb6da9d174f27009f34f0d24"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-7b87bb47c75d501f",
        "text": "After the command finishes, check the resulting state and basic Host health:",
        "headings": [
          "Retry Enablement"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 114,
            "end": 114,
            "text_sha256": "075733f71b774b15adf6a0e5d3e6ee236642d2890ff6dd19eafed2b0e2714803"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "9fb81e050e63c39c37f2f15743a015b8d8670acafa4a8c55a2c89aec878a1de0"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-60ec9280a68ab6d7",
        "text": "```bash\npython3 /var/lib/vastai_kaalia/enable_vms.py check\nnvidia-smi -L\nsystemctl is-active vastai.service docker.service\n```",
        "headings": [
          "Retry Enablement"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 116,
            "end": 120,
            "text_sha256": "ba5d718e6fa23d0dac46fb7848c9fecc58a08032079a9d41188e6ced1683ad9a"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "BLOCKED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "4c69c2c35ff4d988833f508e612ef59a0ab8d30be1820353bb962b9ff64c9617"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-6ebe7cf6297a6cbd",
        "text": "Treat only exact `on` status, visible expected GPUs, and active Host services as a successful enablement. Treat `pending`, `off`, error or abort text, an unexpected status, a missing GPU, or an inactive service as a failure. If IOMMU groups are not set up, correct the BIOS and kernel IOMMU configuration, reboot, and verify the grouping before retrying.",
