        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 51,
            "end": 51,
            "text_sha256": "6879e8c789a34f2dbdccff1b1c82c20efcda37687139f859cbc55de497293c25"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "80aa2f5d1665d74c87c0d04219d76e771d329f2f009b850ddedc3e777d9fabda"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-442f5fb5941fefd1",
        "text": "Disabling VM support changes Host configuration and can disrupt running work. Prevent new rentals during the approved maintenance window, then confirm the machine has no active rentals or other workloads.",
        "headings": [
          "Disable VM Support"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 56,
            "end": 56,
            "text_sha256": "0f33b0dd486f0c8f3d8af01f3c24b937d3f2c0b52cdfdf856c0337e6c7ed7207"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "3b9835c8e93e7534a9537f7386433683cc965d8d5a3496d7eba284da847ba623"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-805d144f549c45af",
        "text": "```bash\nsudo python3 /var/lib/vastai_kaalia/enable_vms.py off\n```",
        "headings": [
          "Disable VM Support"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 59,
            "end": 61,
            "text_sha256": "8c90afca62a634ceac1363e3e2c0cdecb6d68936b3bbfb3c703a140c8b73dd4f"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "2bd09a9bee336c2e0aee92282db0e2e90b624045d502ba3202a59552dc01d358"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-ecf1826f8fa24508",
        "text": "The command marks VM enablement disabled and removes the VM configuration entry when present. It does not stop workloads, end rentals, or verify that the Host is safe to change.",
        "headings": [
          "Disable VM Support"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 63,
            "end": 63,
            "text_sha256": "a1658efb44b404aabd3b515010812961eee9f686d8587801bcd9471c3953e58a"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "bd8de33b641344b569bc8bb81f61f5f1eadbe037a62c09be2e3894fb2eff3d12"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-a9c03c643398c554",
        "text": "Run [Check VM Status](#check-vm-status) afterwards and confirm it reports `off`. Most hosts do not need to disable anything; unsupported machines are detected automatically.",
        "headings": [
          "Disable VM Support"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 65,
            "end": 65,
            "text_sha256": "e6550462360bcbf37e8089b56e6091562725841ef897e1565cfcd8653352c16a"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "c13a7bea51e345e333d4af19fb3d734f969f9ca3e8d239c889e60872845bf893"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-651484f961516c8d",
        "text": "VM support requires CPU/chipset support for Intel VT-d or AMD-Vi, plus BIOS virtualization support.",
        "headings": [
          "Hardware Requirements"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 69,
            "end": 69,
            "text_sha256": "281f998489c54e356912bfe9dc28e47196f530ea4d01eb39a1023744f2a0e093"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "332ae31bed7168ff2f696ff57e35adf19c5b78d2bb85d2ae8de9200887f1a032"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-8239bf0f0e1b0595",
        "text": "In BIOS, enable virtualization and IOMMU/VT-d/AMD-Vi options.",
        "headings": [
          "Hardware Requirements"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 71,
            "end": 71,
            "text_sha256": "f6070516a031999a68037c02b84eaeb7ad3bbdb3f1eee3e4f9024843c618a117"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "0d5081d68c696ffa82129a2d46b3d7f2fa3fccfea7b6c277f1ac0a7dc00ed275"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-36d734fc1acb20ce",
        "text": "Edit `/etc/default/grub` and add the appropriate IOMMU option plus NVIDIA modeset disablement:",
        "headings": [
          "Kernel Options"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 75,
            "end": 75,
            "text_sha256": "01b8f245fb81ee75800c7bfaf2621abbbfdb864e89a8678fbfebe3c230467a71"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "a3e01771c221bd287dafa669adc831a600cdeb2ab3bb9bd9d577639c736008f7"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-24d79fc676359985",
        "text": "```text\nGRUB_CMDLINE_LINUX=\"intel_iommu=on nvidia_drm.modeset=0\"\n```",
        "headings": [
          "Kernel Options"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 77,
            "end": 79,
            "text_sha256": "eec28dc3414b1ed7bad229a15e9cd6ac107dff23f47396c5cfab3a9de02d2075"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "4d32df31df37f1fa8d1c1aaf8f80e4f340b0c9a33fd0dde960b24daa5cf5f031"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-1e3e58a6ee408925",
        "text": "Use `amd_iommu=on` instead of `intel_iommu=on` on AMD platforms.",
        "headings": [
          "Kernel Options"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 81,
            "end": 81,
            "text_sha256": "b495b26e17035ab139b70eaff478033136ab3f0e49de048514c472995d68b189"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "0e8db17763ccc5ca4c5a8462945f6c5db715f99a16aae31b1ab05c0bda3f9601"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-0dfb6daf3258b20a",
        "text": "Some hosts may also need:",
        "headings": [
          "Kernel Options"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 83,
            "end": 83,
            "text_sha256": "d9d0543bbeecd9a18144cf780877a4d082faa08fc5cc4f2e3c7df9e826ab3b9d"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "f558fa5160f002506c7df02b4560d08a8132c26eec5d017521795e3f6af89dfa"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-9c24c283be82dd31",
        "text": "```text\nrd.driver.blacklist=nouveau modprobe.blacklist=nouveau\n```",
        "headings": [
          "Kernel Options"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 85,
            "end": 87,
            "text_sha256": "7a4f918ff0db85896054dd8c0959936e26e1afcb3165c1908f773a9e00f91647"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "af7e58f6bd8911c0ee8d615ebc5ebbeae704abf52c8da6e74d228b1fdd828202"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-5edc91d67bb8cea6",
        "text": "Apply and reboot:",
        "headings": [
          "Kernel Options"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 89,
            "end": 89,
            "text_sha256": "058b6d98d3b6944d75e3c0fc9c9de72c9e0a834e14c26a47deaa55319d8fab00"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "7dfe67b9b49dd1f551f6173a3d5ec3178d6929ff4e4e2b71ccb7edfb7506e064"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-64fd1fc1c1ba0bf8",
        "text": "```bash\nsudo update-grub\nsudo reboot\n```",
        "headings": [
          "Kernel Options"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 91,
            "end": 94,
            "text_sha256": "996070cabda0616f5e29b711507cee6fa9d5a487d916c9f768c5b6be8d344ac5"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "BLOCKED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "cf43a93cc73427984e87a06f4f5dfadecd6a57c85c5675434f482a30dbeb1c06"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-2cf47916d16787bb",
        "text": "Disable display managers, XOrg/Wayland sessions, and background GPU processes. `nvidia-persistenced` is okay because it is managed by the host stack.",
        "headings": [
          "Display Managers And GPU Processes"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 98,
            "end": 98,
            "text_sha256": "9d0c122098967a018b00a5c408c66ef7043cf7f477f54177af795d4518ee48fe"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "48a0937f46914d49c25963507e17bbda941bdb4826dc4410955632357ce4e07b"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-6206cd62295d87e5",
        "text": "If VM support is off and you want to retry after fixing the host:",
        "headings": [
          "Retry Enablement"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 102,
            "end": 102,
            "text_sha256": "b2e2a57d1edfcea0f9f1ed984f2301470948703ab4fde55da2b1cc63d5425517"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "d304ed4a98876f66fbbcb30b48c9531cd5ac62f134b9b4c42d85b209bcb7e23b"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-256a7246625a0529",
        "text": "This is a forced, state-changing setup retry—not a simple toggle. It can install VM packages, pull a test image, restart Host services, and run a GPU-passthrough test. Prevent new rentals during the approved maintenance window, then confirm there are no active rentals, containers, or GPU workloads.",
        "headings": [
          "Retry Enablement"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 105,
            "end": 105,
            "text_sha256": "2f22ad303d55c3faa3bef9f7dd7f6dc5eb1a283899bdbdda64a7659db3d595fc"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "dca33fac3c96a0a383a60a1b7566ee1b93050553b0080134fbbbff77c3efc4d5"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-1bbbc88edc5f88d7",
        "text": "```bash\nsudo python3 /var/lib/vastai_kaalia/enable_vms.py on -f\n```",
        "headings": [
          "Retry Enablement"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 108,
            "end": 110,
            "text_sha256": "f1eb2b3b6c47626bd9a13b771133fd77429c8c1b634925a87cb4db0f0bc9c7ea"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "43980bae78d4dbf56c00fe06f5ec909a7ba9145c5653b0e4acb8416e596de0d1"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-0695e1ca56eca6d4",
        "text": "Do not use process exit status alone as evidence of success. The helper can print an error such as `IOMMU groups not set up for VMs, aborting.` while exiting with status `0`.",
        "headings": [
          "Retry Enablement"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 112,
            "end": 112,
            "text_sha256": "b1ab6cda91e2f5a1460b0a5f48a497b1b89f80455bec768aa7cb10f5378a8b35"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "aed66c3678c6e0ea476980812be4a9e221333419bb6da9d174f27009f34f0d24"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-7b87bb47c75d501f",
        "text": "After the command finishes, check the resulting state and basic Host health:",
        "headings": [
          "Retry Enablement"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 114,
            "end": 114,
            "text_sha256": "075733f71b774b15adf6a0e5d3e6ee236642d2890ff6dd19eafed2b0e2714803"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "9fb81e050e63c39c37f2f15743a015b8d8670acafa4a8c55a2c89aec878a1de0"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-60ec9280a68ab6d7",
        "text": "```bash\npython3 /var/lib/vastai_kaalia/enable_vms.py check\nnvidia-smi -L\nsystemctl is-active vastai.service docker.service\n```",
        "headings": [
          "Retry Enablement"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 116,
            "end": 120,
            "text_sha256": "ba5d718e6fa23d0dac46fb7848c9fecc58a08032079a9d41188e6ced1683ad9a"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "BLOCKED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "4c69c2c35ff4d988833f508e612ef59a0ab8d30be1820353bb962b9ff64c9617"
      },
      {
        "id": "MCL-6ebe7cf6297a6cbd",
        "text": "Treat only exact `on` status, visible expected GPUs, and active Host services as a successful enablement. Treat `pending`, `off`, error or abort text, an unexpected status, a missing GPU, or an inactive service as a failure. If IOMMU groups are not set up, correct the BIOS and kernel IOMMU configuration, reboot, and verify the grouping before retrying.",
        "headings": [
          "Retry Enablement"
        ],
        "spans": [
          {
            "source_file": "host/vms.mdx",
            "start": 122,
            "end": 122,
            "text_sha256": "ff2ae5f58bdada3858b721cf3f260818f595e76fc35e01c7b8a49aa4a4d60c1a"
          }
        ],
        "historical_status": "UNVALIDATED",
        "historical_claim_sha256": "c8ad6c29ce01a63aa977834d0a6a044c554fda1fab28f9eb970aeca7d1ff0d5e"
      }
    ]
  },
